message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Inverse Ladder Microbial Community Case Study: MATLAB implementation of a four-level inverse-problem hierarchy"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible MATLAB implementation of a four-level hierarchy of inverse
  problems (parameter estimation, sparse model discovery, inverse optimal
  control, and inverse differential games) applied to a synthetic two-strain
  cross-feeding microbial consortium. Accompanies the paper "A Hierarchical
  Framework for Inverse Problems in Biological Cybernetics: Opportunities and
  Limitations".
